# Versioned: bmuon/results/ (CSV/JSON) and, for each run, its config, logs and a few
# allocations. Not versioned: data, checkpoints, optimizer states, raw stdout.
# Exception: periodic snap_epoch*.nqx snapshots ARE versioned (off-site backup, for pruning).
data/
runs/**/state.pkl
runs/**/*.nqx
!runs/**/snap_epoch*.nqx
runs/**/stdout.log
runs/**/setup.log
runs/**/alloc_epoch*.npz
!runs/**/alloc_epoch??0.npz
runs/assignments.json
